{"ts": 1791256209.169295, "type": "step", "step": 13, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "pass@k vs pass^k"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.28861117616495185}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.962047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.3482647873598394, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791256210.05349, "type": "step", "step": 14, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/environments.md", "section": "Environment definition"}, "output": "# Agent environments\n\n## What an environment is\nState, observations, actions, dynamics. The reward is a separate claim about what matters.\n\n## Partial observability (POMDP)\nWhen the agent cannot see the full state it must maintain a belief and sometimes act to gather information. Measurement can be an action with a cost.\n\n## Attention as a hidden variable\nLearners do not read everything shown to them. Attention gates learning and drains with fatigue.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.28861117616495185}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.962047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.3482647873598394, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
