{"ts": 1791256211.4452639, "type": "step", "step": 17, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I found the two key parts for Friday: (1) define your environment clearly\u2014state, observations, actions, and dynamics; and (2) evaluate with pass^k, not just pass@k. For the writeup, the eval section should report pass^k on at least 3 seeds. Since you\u2019re stuck there, I\u2019ll help you set up a clean evaluation plan and a template you can fill in.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=6 feed 4m", "t": 10, "activity": [{"t": 6, "app": "feed", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.24531949974020906}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.962047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.3482647873598394, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 5, "feed_minutes": 4.0, "phone_minutes": 1.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": ["p1"]}}
{"ts": 1791256212.844067, "type": "step", "step": 18, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yes \u2014 here\u2019s the direct answer you can use:\n\nFor the build, define the environment as:\n- state: the true underlying situation the agent is in\n- observations: what the agent can actually see\n- actions: the choices the agent can make\n- dynamics: how the state changes after actions\n\nFor evaluation, report pass^k:\n- run the agent k times on each seed\n- count a seed as a success only if all k runs succeed\n- report this over at least 3 seeds\n\nIn one sentence: pass@k means at least one success, while pass^k means all runs succeed, and Friday wants pass^k because it measures reliability.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok", "t": 11, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.24531949974020906}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.966047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.3482647873598394, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 6, "feed_minutes": 5.0, "phone_minutes": 1.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": ["p1", "p2"]}}
